  "messages": [
    {
      "sender": "SYSTEM",
      "recipient": "USER",
      "content": "{{USER_INSTRUCTION}}ROUND 1 [provide: image_1, image_2, image_3, image_4, image_5, image_6]\nQuery: Look at the document listing foods by culture. Check the items listed for Egyptians and cross-reference them with my Groceries project. Add whatever is missing as new tasks.\nInstructions: Ask the assistant to locate the document listing foods by culture, extract the ingredients associated with Egyptians, and cross-reference them with your 'Groceries' project. Tell the assistant to add any missing items as new tasks. If the assistant asks which groceries project to use, clarify that you mean the regular everyday one, not the special event list. If the assistant misses any of the items from the Egyptian list, point it back to the image to double-check. Once the missing items are added, move on to the next round.\n\nROUND 2\nQuery: Now find the corporate governance report. See which directors attended exactly 2 Nominations Committee meetings. Check my directors review folder and create a new empty text file for anyone from that specific group who doesn't have one yet.\nInstructions: Instruct the assistant to find the corporate governance report among the uploaded images and identify the directors who attended exactly two Nominations Committee meetings. Ask it to cross-reference this specific group with the files in your '/directors_review' folder, and create a new empty text file for any of those directors who don't already have one. If the assistant asks for clarification on the naming format, tell it to use the name as it appears in the document but with underscores instead of spaces or periods. Once the missing files are created, proceed to the next round.\n\nROUND 3\nQuery: Finally, find the conference agenda. Look at the speakers scheduled for the Friday morning session. Cross-reference them with my Biographies note and add the names of any speakers that are currently missing.\nInstructions: Ask the assistant to find the conference agenda document and identify the speakers scheduled for the Friday morning session. Tell it to cross-reference these names with your 'Biographies' note and update the note to include any speakers who are currently missing. If the assistant asks which biographies note you mean, specify the general one, not the historical one. Once the note is updated, you can end the conversation.\n\nYou have 6 images available to share with the agent using the send_message_with_image tool.\nIMPORTANT: Image IDs are ZERO-INDEXED integers (0, 1, 2, ...). Do NOT add 1 to the IDs.\nAvailable image IDs: [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]\nImage mapping:\n  image_1.jpg -> image ID 0\n  image_2.jpg -> image ID 1\n  image_3.jpg -> image ID 2\n  image_4.jpg -> image ID 3\n  image_5.jpg -> image ID 4\n  image_6.jpg -> image ID 5"
    },
